    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLF', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Latias & Latios)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Move hits always trigger Eon Resonance and basic attacks have a 35% chance to trigger it (3s ICD). Eon Resonance deals 75% scaled INT in 300 AoE, lowering Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by 1 for 4s and slowing movement by 30% for 2s. Heals you and allies in 450 AoE for 5% max HP and grants +25% AS/MS for 3s and +1 Sp. Atk/Speed for 4s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXWF', "Awakened: |cffffcc00Eon Resonance|r", "+30% All Stats. Move hits always trigger Eon Resonance and basic attacks have a 35% chance (3s ICD). Deals 70% scaled INT in 300 AoE (-1 Sp.Atk/Sp.Def 4s, -30% MS 2s). Heals allies in 450 AoE for 12% max HP and 15% max Mana with +25% AS/MS (3s) and +2 Sp.Atk/Speed (4s).")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLG', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Jirachi)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Move casts have a 35% chance to trigger this effect, which also triggers every 8s in combat (5s ICD). It cleanses and grants you and allies in 450 AoE 8% max HP heal, 15% max Mana, +30% AS for 4s, +1 Attack/Sp. Atk for 5s, and a 20% damage-reduction barrier for 3.5s, then drops Doom Desire on the nearest enemy within 550: 90% scaled Main Stat in 320 AoE, 0.5s stun, and -1 Defense/Sp. Def for 4s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXWG', "Awakened: |cffffcc00Doom Desire|r", "+30% All Stats. Move casts have a 35% chance to trigger, or every 8s in combat (5s ICD). Cleanses and grants allies in 450 AoE 16% max HP heal, 20% max Mana, +30% AS (4s), +2 Atk/Sp.Atk (5s), and a 30% damage barrier (4.5s), then drops Doom Desire for 70% scaled Main Stat in 320 AoE, 0.5s stun, and -1 Def/Sp.Def (4s).")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLI', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Dialga)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Move casts always trigger Roar of Time and hits have a 35% chance to trigger it (4s ICD). Roar of Time deals 95% scaled INT in 340 AoE, stunning 0.6s, slowing movement and attack speed by 40% for 3s, and lowering Speed by 1 for 5s. Restores 12% max mana and grants Dialga +25% attack speed for 3s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXWI', "Awakened: |cffffcc00Roar of Time|r", "+30% All Stats. Move casts always trigger Roar of Time and hits have a 35% chance to trigger it (4s ICD). Roar of Time deals 95% scaled INT in 340 AoE, stunning 0.6s, slowing movement and attack speed by 40% for 3s, and lowering Speed by 1 for 5s. Restores 12% max mana and grants Dialga +25% attack speed for 3s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLJ', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Palkia)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Move hits always trigger Spacial Rend and basic attacks have a 35% chance to trigger it (3s ICD). Spacial Rend deals 85% scaled INT in 300 AoE; 25% chance to deal 1.5x Spacial Crit damage. Slows movement by 35% for 2.5s and lowers Defense and Sp. Def by 1 for 4s. Grants Palkia +20% movement speed for 2.5s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXWJ', "Awakened: |cffffcc00Spacial Rend|r", "+30% All Stats. Move hits always trigger Spacial Rend and basic attacks have a 35% chance to trigger it (3s ICD). Spacial Rend deals 85% scaled INT in 300 AoE; 25% chance to deal 1.5x Spacial Crit damage. Slows movement by 35% for 2.5s, lowers Defense and Sp. Def by 1 for 4s, and grants Palkia +20% movement speed for 2.5s.")
    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLK', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Giratina)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Takes 10% less damage. Hits have a 35% chance (3s ICD) to deal 65% scaled STR plus 4% max HP in 300 AoE, slows movement and attack speed by 30% for 2s, lowers Attack and Defense by 1 for 4s, and heals Giratina for 6% max HP.")
