    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXLL', "Hidden Power: |cff999999Locked (Darkrai)|r", "+30% All Stats. Complete Awakening Quest Chain (-quest). Unlocked: Hits have a 35% chance (3.5s ICD) to deal 75% scaled INT in 340 AoE, increased by 35% against sleeping targets. Each enemy has a 45% chance to fall asleep; the blast slows movement by 35% for 2.5s and lowers Sp. Def and Speed by 1 for 4s. Heals 5% max HP and restores 10% max mana.")
