    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXP3', "Mega: |cffffcc00Psystrike Clash|r", "+30% All Stats. Orbs deal 50% scaled INT; basic attacks have a 35% chance (2.5s ICD) to cleave in 280 AoE for 85% scaled STR, stun 0.5s, lower Def by 1 (5s), heal 6% max HP, and grant +25% AS and +15% MS (3s). Melee hits push attackers 450 away for 65% scaled STR.")
