    call PAX_Leg_SetTip('AXP5', "Mega: |cffffcc00Luster Purge|r", "+30% All Stats. Move hits always trigger Luster Purge and basic attacks have a 35% chance (2.5s ICD). Deals 85% scaled INT in 360 AoE (-1 Sp.Atk/Sp.Def 5s, -35% MS 2.5s). Restores 16% max HP and 20% max Mana to allies in 450 AoE with +35% AS/MS (3s) and +2 Sp.Atk/Speed (4s).")
